1
00:00:30,380 --> 00:00:31,220
What is it?

2
00:00:33,380 --> 00:00:35,620
Did giving me this house as our newlywed home

3
00:00:35,840 --> 00:00:36,780
embarrass you so much

4
00:00:36,800 --> 00:00:38,060
you moved to San Francisco?

5
00:00:40,020 --> 00:00:41,420
Anyway, thank you.

6
00:00:43,300 --> 00:00:44,740
I promise

7
00:00:45,420 --> 00:00:47,620
I'll make the most of our newlywed home.

8
00:00:52,740 --> 00:00:53,980
Direk, I'm hanging up now.

9
00:00:54,040 --> 00:00:55,220
Gotta help my boyfriend carry our stuff.

10
00:00:55,620 --> 00:00:56,360
Babe,

11
00:00:56,580 --> 00:00:57,980
why are you doing this by yourself?

12
00:00:58,820 --> 00:01:00,220
Look at you.

13
00:01:00,850 --> 00:01:02,020
Well, it's my stuff.

14
00:01:02,700 --> 00:01:03,780
If I don't carry it,

15
00:01:03,800 --> 00:01:05,300
who will?

16
00:01:06,700 --> 00:01:07,460
Your boyfriend.

17
00:01:08,300 --> 00:01:09,180
Arthit.

18
00:01:15,540 --> 00:01:16,660
Whether it's stuff

19
00:01:19,900 --> 00:01:21,380
or a person,

20
00:01:22,140 --> 00:01:23,380
I can carry it all.

21
00:01:26,660 --> 00:01:27,660
Do you wanna try?

22
00:01:28,160 --> 00:01:29,060
Arthit,

23
00:01:29,680 --> 00:01:31,180
don't tease me like this.

24
00:01:34,820 --> 00:01:35,860
Don't scold me.

25
00:01:36,440 --> 00:01:37,820
You're cute when you do that, you know?

26
00:01:39,780 --> 00:01:40,620
Arthit!

27
00:01:43,900 --> 00:01:45,660
I told you to stop scolding me.

28
00:01:46,580 --> 00:01:48,180
See? You're cute.

29
00:01:50,740 --> 00:01:52,260
If I can't resist,

30
00:01:52,980 --> 00:01:54,060
you'll blame me again.

31
00:01:55,380 --> 00:01:56,620
Just stop it.

32
00:01:57,580 --> 00:01:59,180
We're right in front of the house.

33
00:02:01,800 --> 00:02:02,580
So?

34
00:02:03,420 --> 00:02:05,100
Let's get inside.

35
00:02:05,700 --> 00:02:06,900
It's hot.

36
00:02:06,940 --> 00:02:07,940
You mean...

37
00:02:08,900 --> 00:02:10,300
you want to continue inside?

38
00:02:12,020 --> 00:02:13,820
How naughty. / You're annoying.

39
00:02:17,220 --> 00:02:18,700
Why do you keep looking at me?

40
00:02:21,680 --> 00:02:22,580
Thank you

41
00:02:23,240 --> 00:02:24,460
for moving in with me.

42
00:02:27,820 --> 00:02:28,500
Mm.

43
00:02:32,720 --> 00:02:34,980
That's all you're gonna say?

44
00:02:35,320 --> 00:02:36,060
Huh?

45
00:02:36,340 --> 00:02:37,700
What do you want me to say, then?

46
00:02:39,300 --> 00:02:42,220
Anything. Just a little more, please.

47
00:02:43,320 --> 00:02:44,780
I moved here

48
00:02:45,540 --> 00:02:47,180
because I want to be with you.

49
00:02:48,460 --> 00:02:49,980
I want to see Arthit

50
00:02:50,560 --> 00:02:52,140
everywhere I go.

51
00:02:53,540 --> 00:02:54,860
I love you, Arthit.

52
00:03:06,140 --> 00:03:07,540
I love you so much.

53
00:03:10,020 --> 00:03:10,700
Let's go.

54
00:03:18,500 --> 00:03:19,180
Babe.

55
00:03:19,540 --> 00:03:20,540
Wait for me, babe!

56
00:03:21,020 --> 00:03:22,100
Babe, wait!

57
00:03:47,600 --> 00:03:48,880
Mrs. Puangthong,

58
00:03:50,560 --> 00:03:52,560
I've moved into Arthit's house.

59
00:04:00,420 --> 00:04:02,960
Mrs. Puangthong is welcome to enter this house.

60
00:04:04,440 --> 00:04:06,040
I'll let the guardian spirit know.

61
00:04:07,880 --> 00:04:10,280
Mrs. Puangthong has gone to Heaven.

62
00:04:11,160 --> 00:04:13,040
She won't be coming here.

63
00:04:13,640 --> 00:04:14,320
Oh?

64
00:04:14,920 --> 00:04:16,440
I saw you talking to her,

65
00:04:16,680 --> 00:04:18,400
so I thought she'd followed us here.

66
00:04:19,200 --> 00:04:20,530
All that remains with me

67
00:04:20,560 --> 00:04:21,920
is her love.

68
00:04:22,720 --> 00:04:24,080
I can feel it.

69
00:04:31,080 --> 00:04:32,040
And...

70
00:04:32,400 --> 00:04:33,800
what about my love?

71
00:04:40,560 --> 00:04:41,720
Can you feel it?

72
00:04:52,800 --> 00:04:54,120
What do you want for dinner?

73
00:04:54,420 --> 00:04:55,680
I'll cook for you.

74
00:04:58,980 --> 00:05:00,880
Moving in is exhausting enough.

75
00:05:02,640 --> 00:05:04,280
Let's just order takeout today.

76
00:05:09,560 --> 00:05:10,520
Okay.

77
00:05:13,200 --> 00:05:14,280
You're the cutest.

78
00:05:15,360 --> 00:05:16,080
Let's go.

79
00:05:23,140 --> 00:05:24,120
Arthit.

80
00:05:34,480 --> 00:05:36,080
Arthit... / It's okay, it's okay...

81
00:05:36,140 --> 00:05:37,180
Arthit...

82
00:05:37,200 --> 00:05:38,120
I'm here.

83
00:05:38,700 --> 00:05:39,960
Calm down.

84
00:05:40,360 --> 00:05:41,200
Calm down...

85
00:05:41,560 --> 00:05:43,840
It's okay.

86
00:05:46,780 --> 00:05:47,880
Calm down.

87
00:05:47,900 --> 00:05:49,480
Calm down and sit here first.

88
00:05:49,860 --> 00:05:50,640
Sit here.

89
00:05:55,940 --> 00:05:56,900
It's okay.

90
00:06:03,220 --> 00:06:03,880
And...

91
00:06:04,820 --> 00:06:06,120
what do we do next?

92
00:06:07,060 --> 00:06:09,060
Where can we buy this bracelet?

93
00:06:09,940 --> 00:06:11,800
Where can we find it? Just tell me,

94
00:06:12,040 --> 00:06:13,360
and I'll get it for you right away.

95
00:06:15,280 --> 00:06:16,040
Arthit...

96
00:06:16,560 --> 00:06:17,840
I'm fine now.

97
00:06:20,260 --> 00:06:20,880
But...

98
00:06:21,140 --> 00:06:22,640
if you don't have this bracelet on,

99
00:06:23,360 --> 00:06:24,920
wouldn't you be in danger?

100
00:06:25,520 --> 00:06:27,720
When we were at a cemetery in San Francisco,

101
00:06:28,740 --> 00:06:31,000
you weren't wearing it for just a moment,

102
00:06:31,800 --> 00:06:33,440
and you ended up in the hospital.

103
00:06:36,880 --> 00:06:38,720
I can't lose you.

104
00:06:56,320 --> 00:06:57,220
Arthit.

105
00:06:58,680 --> 00:06:59,920
Calm down.

106
00:07:02,340 --> 00:07:04,960
Nothing has happened yet.

107
00:07:07,880 --> 00:07:09,880
But you were shaking so badly, Daotok.

108
00:07:17,000 --> 00:07:18,160
This bracelet

109
00:07:19,160 --> 00:07:21,680
is the one Mrs. Puangthong put on me

110
00:07:22,480 --> 00:07:25,000
when she found out I wasn't like other kids.

111
00:07:26,000 --> 00:07:27,440
So when it broke,

112
00:07:27,960 --> 00:07:29,160
I was shocked.

113
00:07:30,560 --> 00:07:31,880
I'm sorry

114
00:07:33,160 --> 00:07:35,040
I startled you, too.

115
00:07:39,080 --> 00:07:40,480
What do we do next?

116
00:07:41,800 --> 00:07:43,280
If you don't have this bracelet,

117
00:07:43,600 --> 00:07:44,680
will you be okay?

118
00:07:48,980 --> 00:07:49,640
Huh?

119
00:08:07,860 --> 00:08:08,640
Arthit...

120
00:08:10,100 --> 00:08:10,880
You're bleeding...

121
00:08:32,780 --> 00:08:34,380
Tell me if it hurts.

122
00:08:37,960 --> 00:08:39,000
It won't hurt.

123
00:08:39,640 --> 00:08:40,480
Just do it.

124
00:08:42,080 --> 00:08:43,560
How could it not hurt?

125
00:08:44,520 --> 00:08:45,960
The wound is pretty bad.

126
00:08:52,560 --> 00:08:54,200
Maybe I was so worried about you

127
00:08:55,060 --> 00:08:56,060
that I didn't even feel the pain.

128
00:08:58,680 --> 00:09:01,000
Do you think you're the only one who's worried?

129
00:09:06,440 --> 00:09:07,860
I'm not done yet.

130
00:09:23,400 --> 00:09:24,940
Are you sure you're okay?

131
00:09:31,080 --> 00:09:33,240
So, you'd just let something happen to me?

132
00:09:39,360 --> 00:09:40,400
No way.

133
00:09:42,960 --> 00:09:45,200
I'd never let that happen.

134
00:09:48,520 --> 00:09:50,040
Then that's enough.

135
00:09:51,300 --> 00:09:53,520
Just knowing you're by my side,

136
00:09:54,720 --> 00:09:55,480
I'm...

137
00:09:56,360 --> 00:09:57,920
not afraid of anything.

138
00:09:59,440 --> 00:10:00,840
So,

139
00:10:01,960 --> 00:10:03,960
don't overthink it anymore,

140
00:10:05,080 --> 00:10:06,000
babe.

141
00:10:15,280 --> 00:10:16,440
What did you just say?

142
00:10:17,600 --> 00:10:19,160
I said,

143
00:10:19,760 --> 00:10:20,920
"Just knowing Arthit's by my side,

144
00:10:21,160 --> 00:10:22,680
I'm not afraid of anything."

145
00:10:24,960 --> 00:10:26,160
Not that one.

146
00:10:27,400 --> 00:10:28,520
The other one.

147
00:10:29,980 --> 00:10:30,760
Hmm?

148
00:10:33,040 --> 00:10:35,040
"Don't overthink it anymore,

149
00:10:38,260 --> 00:10:39,180
babe."

150
00:10:49,580 --> 00:10:50,620
You're making me blush.

151
00:10:53,160 --> 00:10:54,400
Ouch! It hurts...

152
00:10:55,080 --> 00:10:56,360
Ow... / Oh, please.

153
00:10:57,280 --> 00:10:58,160
It's done.

154
00:11:09,020 --> 00:11:10,360
Are you really okay?

155
00:11:11,020 --> 00:11:11,800
Hm?

156
00:11:12,480 --> 00:11:13,510
Mm.

157
00:11:15,220 --> 00:11:16,160
Promise?

158
00:11:16,180 --> 00:11:17,560
I promise.

159
00:12:24,460 --> 00:12:25,160
Go away!

160
00:12:25,410 --> 00:12:26,070
Who!

161
00:12:26,230 --> 00:12:26,760
Told you!

162
00:12:26,780 --> 00:12:27,830
To come!

163
00:12:27,850 --> 00:12:28,880
Into my room?!

164
00:12:28,900 --> 00:12:29,620
Leave!

165
00:12:29,640 --> 00:12:31,600
You wanna die a second time, you asshole?!

166
00:12:35,040 --> 00:12:36,320
Oh, babe...

167
00:12:36,350 --> 00:12:38,760
It's okay, it's okay.

168
00:13:04,520 --> 00:13:05,160
Hey.

169
00:13:07,720 --> 00:13:08,720
Thank you.

170
00:13:14,800 --> 00:13:16,200
You really can't take a day off?

171
00:13:17,320 --> 00:13:18,360
I can't.

172
00:13:18,700 --> 00:13:20,420
It's too short notice.

173
00:13:20,680 --> 00:13:22,800
They can't find a substitute teacher in time.

174
00:13:25,960 --> 00:13:27,040
But...

175
00:13:33,620 --> 00:13:34,920
Have a great day at work.

176
00:13:39,260 --> 00:13:40,320
Can you do it again?

177
00:13:44,920 --> 00:13:45,600
Mm...

178
00:13:47,160 --> 00:13:48,360
You, too.

179
00:13:49,240 --> 00:13:50,120
I'll come pick you up.

180
00:13:53,280 --> 00:13:53,960
I'm off now.

181
00:13:55,000 --> 00:13:55,960
I love you.

182
00:14:05,560 --> 00:14:08,280
Arthit! Help!

183
00:14:10,720 --> 00:14:11,480
Daotok.

184
00:14:11,840 --> 00:14:12,560
Daotok!

185
00:14:12,580 --> 00:14:13,160
Daotok!

186
00:14:13,760 --> 00:14:14,560
Daotok!

187
00:14:16,720 --> 00:14:17,560
Daotok!!

188
00:14:18,440 --> 00:14:19,720
Daotok, where are you?!

189
00:14:22,700 --> 00:14:25,520
[Die]

190
00:14:29,600 --> 00:14:30,360
Daotok!

191
00:14:30,850 --> 00:14:32,680
Daotok, where are you?!

192
00:14:32,780 --> 00:14:33,580
Daotok!!

193
00:14:33,880 --> 00:14:34,640
Arthit...

194
00:14:35,240 --> 00:14:36,240
Help me.

195
00:14:40,420 --> 00:14:41,400
Daotok...

196
00:14:44,640 --> 00:14:45,480
Daotok!

197
00:14:46,600 --> 00:14:47,280
Daotok!!

198
00:14:48,480 --> 00:14:49,200
Daotok!

199
00:14:50,300 --> 00:14:51,040
Daotok!

200
00:14:55,200 --> 00:14:55,920
Daotok!!

201
00:14:56,800 --> 00:14:57,640
Daotok...

202
00:15:02,840 --> 00:15:03,640
Daotok!

203
00:15:05,360 --> 00:15:06,200
Arthit.

204
00:15:07,480 --> 00:15:08,200
Arthit.

205
00:15:10,960 --> 00:15:12,280
Don't let anything happen to you, okay?

206
00:15:15,860 --> 00:15:17,640
Just what happened to you?

207
00:15:18,160 --> 00:15:19,480
A nightmare?

208
00:15:24,840 --> 00:15:26,120
Please be okay.

209
00:15:32,020 --> 00:15:33,440
Hey, Arthit...

210
00:15:40,360 --> 00:15:41,240
Arthit.

211
00:15:42,420 --> 00:15:44,200
I'm completely fine.

212
00:15:46,000 --> 00:15:47,720
It was just a dream.

213
00:15:48,960 --> 00:15:50,880
I'm right here with you.

214
00:15:51,480 --> 00:15:52,920
I'm here.

215
00:16:09,560 --> 00:16:11,680
It felt so real, Daotok.

216
00:16:14,240 --> 00:16:15,360
I know

217
00:16:16,040 --> 00:16:17,640
you're really worried about me.

218
00:16:27,380 --> 00:16:28,040
Are you...

219
00:16:29,840 --> 00:16:31,240
Are you reading my emotions?

220
00:16:34,240 --> 00:16:36,360
Without Mrs. Puangthong's bracelet,

221
00:16:37,340 --> 00:16:39,720
it's very hard to control it.

222
00:16:40,800 --> 00:16:42,720
I'm sorry in advance

223
00:16:43,320 --> 00:16:46,000
if I happen to read your emotions.

224
00:16:48,080 --> 00:16:49,760
I really didn't mean to.

225
00:17:03,900 --> 00:17:04,720
Truth be told,

226
00:17:05,540 --> 00:17:07,200
I have nothing to hide from you.

227
00:17:09,620 --> 00:17:10,840
Inside this heart,

228
00:17:13,400 --> 00:17:15,040
there is nothing but you.

229
00:17:20,000 --> 00:17:21,360
Since you've been by my side,

230
00:17:22,760 --> 00:17:24,440
I haven't thought about anything

231
00:17:25,280 --> 00:17:26,920
or anyone else.

232
00:17:34,920 --> 00:17:36,480
Arthit, are you obsessed with me?

233
00:17:44,800 --> 00:17:47,280
That word has a double meaning, you know?

234
00:17:52,920 --> 00:17:54,400
Can't you let me have this touching moment?

235
00:17:55,160 --> 00:17:56,720
You always have to bring this up.

236
00:18:00,600 --> 00:18:02,320
I know you're worried about me,

237
00:18:03,540 --> 00:18:05,360
but I'm totally fine.

238
00:18:22,860 --> 00:18:24,160
Can you not go today?

239
00:18:25,240 --> 00:18:26,320
I can't.

240
00:18:26,920 --> 00:18:28,620
Can't find a substitute in time.

241
00:18:34,280 --> 00:18:36,080
Once I'm done at the recording studio,

242
00:18:36,810 --> 00:18:38,140
I'll make my way to you, okay?

243
00:18:40,940 --> 00:18:42,480
The class is probably shorter than usual.

244
00:18:42,860 --> 00:18:45,280
Today's workshop only lasts two hours.

245
00:18:45,800 --> 00:18:47,520
Then, come and wait for me at the studio.

246
00:18:47,720 --> 00:18:48,800
Let's head home together,

247
00:18:49,160 --> 00:18:49,880
okay?

248
00:18:50,240 --> 00:18:51,140
Of course.

249
00:18:56,440 --> 00:18:57,600
Why this shirt?

250
00:18:58,880 --> 00:18:59,840
Why?

251
00:19:00,060 --> 00:19:01,880
It's comfortable.

252
00:19:02,240 --> 00:19:03,820
It's thin,

253
00:19:03,840 --> 00:19:05,120
and the neckline is deep.

254
00:19:05,460 --> 00:19:07,460
You'll have to bend down while teaching.

255
00:19:07,660 --> 00:19:09,000
No, you can't wear this.

256
00:19:09,380 --> 00:19:11,000
Get rid of it, okay?

257
00:19:12,200 --> 00:19:13,240
I won't let you wear it.

258
00:19:14,100 --> 00:19:15,760
After all this time together,

259
00:19:16,480 --> 00:19:18,600
you're still worrying over nothing?

260
00:19:19,600 --> 00:19:21,480
You never stop being this sweet.

261
00:19:23,160 --> 00:19:24,800
How could I not worry about you?

262
00:19:38,920 --> 00:19:40,040
Why are you so cute?

263
00:19:42,800 --> 00:19:45,480
Have you said this like 10,000 times already?

264
00:19:46,220 --> 00:19:47,920
I'm starting to get tired of hearing it.

265
00:19:52,280 --> 00:19:54,040
I don't know what else to say.

266
00:19:55,520 --> 00:19:56,960
It's because you really are cute.

267
00:20:02,100 --> 00:20:04,100
We have to head out to work soon.

268
00:20:07,880 --> 00:20:09,640
Come on, traffic won't be that bad today.

269
00:20:19,600 --> 00:20:21,840
Why wear it just to take it off?

270
00:20:22,260 --> 00:20:23,960
Can't you see it's all wrinkled now?

271
00:20:25,600 --> 00:20:27,880
I thought you wouldn't take it off.

272
00:20:31,060 --> 00:20:32,640
And you think you have my permission?

273
00:20:34,860 --> 00:20:35,800
So, will you?

274
00:20:37,120 --> 00:20:37,760
Hm?

275
00:20:41,120 --> 00:20:42,640
I can only spare 30 minutes.

276
00:20:43,680 --> 00:20:45,280
I can't give you more than that.

277
00:21:25,500 --> 00:21:26,160
Hey...

278
00:21:27,340 --> 00:21:29,000
It was just a dream.

279
00:21:29,640 --> 00:21:31,480
It wasn't real.

280
00:21:34,080 --> 00:21:35,080
I know.

281
00:21:36,080 --> 00:21:37,340
I'm trying,

282
00:21:39,380 --> 00:21:41,120
but I can't help worrying about you.

283
00:21:43,400 --> 00:21:45,200
We can't help how we feel, can we?

284
00:21:51,380 --> 00:21:52,720
See you this evening.

285
00:22:02,420 --> 00:22:03,120
Mm.

286
00:22:09,820 --> 00:22:10,560
I'll get going now.

287
00:22:14,040 --> 00:22:14,800
Arthit.

288
00:22:16,080 --> 00:22:16,760
Hm?

289
00:22:18,820 --> 00:22:19,920
Can I have a hug?

290
00:22:33,280 --> 00:22:35,280
I know you're worried about me,

291
00:22:36,080 --> 00:22:38,400
but I promise I'll be fine,

292
00:22:38,740 --> 00:22:39,740
okay?

293
00:22:41,240 --> 00:22:42,280
Mm...

294
00:22:43,280 --> 00:22:44,120
Promise?

295
00:22:59,360 --> 00:23:00,840
You feel better now, don't you?

296
00:23:02,060 --> 00:23:03,520
Mm...

297
00:23:04,520 --> 00:23:05,280
Well...

298
00:23:05,800 --> 00:23:06,720
Kind of.

299
00:23:09,960 --> 00:23:11,480
Do your best today, okay?

300
00:23:11,580 --> 00:23:12,280
Mm.

301
00:23:13,460 --> 00:23:14,320
Okay.

302
00:23:15,220 --> 00:23:16,000
You too, okay?

303
00:23:20,040 --> 00:23:21,080
Well then...

304
00:23:23,800 --> 00:23:24,900
I'm off for real this time.

305
00:23:25,540 --> 00:23:26,480
Okay.

306
00:23:32,520 --> 00:23:33,400
Want more hugs?

307
00:23:34,000 --> 00:23:34,800
I'm good.

308
00:23:35,060 --> 00:23:35,960
But I do.

309
00:23:41,080 --> 00:23:42,600
That's enough.

310
00:23:45,060 --> 00:23:46,480
I really don't wanna leave.

311
00:23:51,280 --> 00:23:52,120
I'm off now.

312
00:23:53,240 --> 00:23:54,160
One more hug?

313
00:23:56,840 --> 00:23:57,680
I'll go now,

314
00:23:58,720 --> 00:23:59,620
for real this time.

315
00:23:59,800 --> 00:24:00,480
Right.

316
00:24:32,900 --> 00:24:33,800
That's great.

317
00:24:40,400 --> 00:24:42,070
I think more white here

318
00:24:42,090 --> 00:24:43,040
would be better.

319
00:25:06,320 --> 00:25:08,520
Shit! So fucking cute!

320
00:25:10,380 --> 00:25:11,680
Hey, guys.

321
00:25:12,520 --> 00:25:13,520
Come on! Let's do it.

322
00:25:17,920 --> 00:25:19,280
I think

323
00:25:19,640 --> 00:25:20,920
that's it for today.

324
00:26:27,420 --> 00:26:28,560
Let go.

325
00:27:49,000 --> 00:27:49,880
What's wrong?

326
00:27:52,520 --> 00:27:53,200
Hm?

327
00:27:58,660 --> 00:27:59,600
I'm exhausted.

328
00:28:00,640 --> 00:28:02,520
I've been followed all day.

329
00:28:05,640 --> 00:28:07,640
But I feel better with you here.

330
00:28:10,660 --> 00:28:11,540
Do you really feel better,

331
00:28:11,560 --> 00:28:13,520
or is that just a white lie?

332
00:28:15,520 --> 00:28:17,000
I really do feel better.

333
00:28:19,240 --> 00:28:20,920
I don't know why,

334
00:28:23,240 --> 00:28:24,800
but I really feel better.

335
00:28:29,600 --> 00:28:30,600
Weird.

336
00:28:32,520 --> 00:28:33,520
So...

337
00:28:34,400 --> 00:28:36,080
I have powers, too?

338
00:28:44,540 --> 00:28:46,640
I don't think that has anything to do with it.

339
00:28:50,300 --> 00:28:52,400
You're probably scarier than a ghost.

340
00:28:53,500 --> 00:28:54,640
Hey, hey, hey.

341
00:28:55,100 --> 00:28:56,520
That's a bit much.

342
00:28:56,900 --> 00:28:59,120
I'm not that scary, am I?

343
00:29:00,480 --> 00:29:01,080
Huh?

344
00:29:02,840 --> 00:29:04,120
You're gonna get it.

345
00:29:10,260 --> 00:29:10,960
Hey.

346
00:29:12,920 --> 00:29:13,900
Shall we head home?

347
00:29:15,000 --> 00:29:16,380
You look really exhausted.

348
00:29:18,080 --> 00:29:19,760
Let me stay here for a bit longer.

349
00:29:32,180 --> 00:29:32,880
See?

350
00:29:33,840 --> 00:29:35,120
You're always like this.

351
00:29:35,900 --> 00:29:37,840
How could I not worry about you?

352
00:30:08,000 --> 00:30:08,680
Hey.

353
00:30:09,600 --> 00:30:10,760
Go take a shower

354
00:30:11,000 --> 00:30:12,080
and get some rest.

355
00:30:13,480 --> 00:30:14,480
Mm...

356
00:30:16,860 --> 00:30:17,640
Then...

357
00:30:18,440 --> 00:30:19,320
I'll help you shower.

358
00:30:24,580 --> 00:30:26,600
I don't have any ulterior motives. I swear.

359
00:30:33,380 --> 00:30:34,560
I mean it.

360
00:30:35,200 --> 00:30:37,460
Well, you look exhausted,

361
00:30:37,480 --> 00:30:38,480
so I'm worried.

362
00:30:40,200 --> 00:30:42,520
I want to help you however I can.

363
00:30:42,660 --> 00:30:44,580
Let me take care of my boyfriend, okay?

364
00:30:45,420 --> 00:30:46,180
Look.

365
00:30:46,660 --> 00:30:48,320
Can you not be so pessimistic?

366
00:30:49,160 --> 00:30:51,800
Is your mind ever not in the gutter?

367
00:30:53,940 --> 00:30:54,840
Wow...

368
00:30:55,260 --> 00:30:56,200
okay.

369
00:31:01,740 --> 00:31:02,660
Thank you.

370
00:31:06,520 --> 00:31:07,940
I'll leave it to you, then.

371
00:31:11,480 --> 00:31:12,640
Leave it to me?

372
00:31:13,540 --> 00:31:14,480
Mm...

373
00:31:15,600 --> 00:31:16,840
I'm a bit tired.

374
00:31:24,720 --> 00:31:25,480
Okay, then.

375
00:31:26,400 --> 00:31:27,200
Come here.

376
00:31:33,580 --> 00:31:34,240
Hey.

377
00:31:34,760 --> 00:31:36,400
You sure you can go to work tomorrow?

378
00:31:37,980 --> 00:31:39,880
I've already requested a substitute teacher.

379
00:31:40,760 --> 00:31:42,520
Probably won't be able to make it tomorrow.

380
00:31:45,280 --> 00:31:46,640
Is it that bad?

381
00:31:55,560 --> 00:31:57,320
I'll get used to it, I guess.

382
00:32:00,320 --> 00:32:01,700
I'm not the only one

383
00:32:01,720 --> 00:32:03,960
who has a sixth sense.

384
00:32:05,600 --> 00:32:07,120
Your grandma's bracelet...

385
00:32:08,800 --> 00:32:11,000
You really can't find another one anywhere else?

386
00:32:15,280 --> 00:32:16,800
I've never asked her.

387
00:32:19,720 --> 00:32:22,680
And now I don't even know who else I could ask.

388
00:32:38,160 --> 00:32:39,720
But it's okay.

389
00:32:41,800 --> 00:32:43,960
Even without the bracelet,

390
00:32:47,060 --> 00:32:48,640
I've still got you, Arthit.

391
00:32:55,680 --> 00:32:56,360
See?

392
00:32:57,840 --> 00:32:59,960
You're always so sweet.

393
00:33:32,580 --> 00:33:33,440
Arthit.

394
00:33:36,960 --> 00:33:37,640
Hm?

395
00:33:40,480 --> 00:33:41,800
Still awake?

396
00:33:46,680 --> 00:33:47,680
Even when you're asleep,

397
00:33:47,700 --> 00:33:49,360
you're still using your power?

398
00:33:50,540 --> 00:33:52,320
I didn't mean to...

399
00:33:57,640 --> 00:33:58,720
Okay.

400
00:34:00,280 --> 00:34:02,000
Sleep tight, okay?

401
00:34:02,680 --> 00:34:04,120
You should sleep.

402
00:34:04,180 --> 00:34:04,880
Mm.

403
00:34:05,240 --> 00:34:06,720
It's really late.

404
00:34:10,160 --> 00:34:10,960
Daotok...

405
00:34:13,320 --> 00:34:14,160
Daotok!

406
00:34:14,920 --> 00:34:15,720
Daotok!

407
00:34:17,280 --> 00:34:18,840
Daotok... Daotok.

408
00:34:19,360 --> 00:34:20,120
Daotok...

409
00:34:21,800 --> 00:34:23,240
No, Daotok!

410
00:34:25,360 --> 00:34:26,800
Somebody help!

411
00:34:29,420 --> 00:34:30,240
Daotok!

412
00:35:27,620 --> 00:35:28,640
Where is it?

413
00:35:55,740 --> 00:35:56,440
Arthit.

414
00:35:58,600 --> 00:35:59,640
What are you doing?

415
00:36:05,080 --> 00:36:06,440
Uh...

416
00:36:07,640 --> 00:36:11,200
I just want to look for something down there.

417
00:36:12,160 --> 00:36:13,240
Down where?

418
00:36:17,940 --> 00:36:19,940
I know it sounds stupid,

419
00:36:20,280 --> 00:36:22,160
but I don't know what to do anymore.

420
00:36:23,760 --> 00:36:26,240
I just want you to be able to live a normal life.

421
00:36:29,660 --> 00:36:32,040
I don't want anything to happen to you.

422
00:36:33,040 --> 00:36:34,540
How could I live without you?

423
00:36:34,560 --> 00:36:35,820
I couldn't do that!

424
00:36:35,840 --> 00:36:36,640
Come here.

425
00:36:42,360 --> 00:36:44,120
Everything is fine.

426
00:36:46,760 --> 00:36:48,640
I'm here with you, Arthit.

427
00:36:53,600 --> 00:36:54,680
Do you understand?

428
00:37:17,100 --> 00:37:18,360
I had a nightmare again.

429
00:37:21,960 --> 00:37:23,400
A dream is just a dream.

430
00:37:24,160 --> 00:37:26,000
It didn't actually happen.

431
00:37:27,700 --> 00:37:29,400
I've reassured you about this so many times.

432
00:37:42,760 --> 00:37:44,680
Actually, this bracelet

433
00:37:46,720 --> 00:37:48,580
isn't an amulet at all.

434
00:37:52,880 --> 00:37:53,560
Huh?!

435
00:37:54,720 --> 00:37:55,560
What did you say?

436
00:38:06,540 --> 00:38:07,600
When I was young,

437
00:38:07,700 --> 00:38:10,200
whenever I was with Mrs. Puangthong,

438
00:38:10,460 --> 00:38:12,600
everything felt lighter.

439
00:38:14,400 --> 00:38:16,960
So she gave me this bracelet

440
00:38:17,780 --> 00:38:19,320
as a reminder of her,

441
00:38:19,940 --> 00:38:22,120
so I'd feel close to her

442
00:38:22,860 --> 00:38:24,320
whenever we were apart.

443
00:38:28,720 --> 00:38:30,760
Wouldn't you call this an amulet already?

444
00:38:37,040 --> 00:38:38,720
It's simply a symbol

445
00:38:40,200 --> 00:38:41,560
of Mrs. Puangthong's love

446
00:38:41,860 --> 00:38:43,860
and care for me.

447
00:38:46,360 --> 00:38:47,380
These two things

448
00:38:47,400 --> 00:38:49,680
have been protecting me all this time.

449
00:38:55,680 --> 00:38:57,360
I've told you...

450
00:39:00,800 --> 00:39:02,800
you can't buy it anywhere else.

451
00:39:13,000 --> 00:39:15,160
For people with the sixth sense

452
00:39:17,480 --> 00:39:19,640
or people like me,

453
00:39:21,000 --> 00:39:22,020
what I experience

454
00:39:22,040 --> 00:39:23,680
isn't unusual at all.

455
00:39:25,900 --> 00:39:28,680
We just need some time to get used to it.

456
00:39:31,840 --> 00:39:33,280
So how long is this going to take?

457
00:39:36,240 --> 00:39:38,080
I don't know either.

458
00:39:50,860 --> 00:39:52,320
No matter how many days,

459
00:39:53,720 --> 00:39:54,680
months,

460
00:39:55,900 --> 00:39:56,880
or years it takes,

461
00:39:59,120 --> 00:40:01,040
I'll stay by your side...

462
00:40:02,040 --> 00:40:03,320
forever.

463
00:40:10,080 --> 00:40:11,280
I know.

464
00:40:23,360 --> 00:40:24,360
Thank you.

465
00:40:24,920 --> 00:40:25,720
Mm.

466
00:40:40,720 --> 00:40:42,520
Ow, it hurts!

467
00:40:43,440 --> 00:40:44,080
Babe.

468
00:40:44,680 --> 00:40:45,680
Ow!

469
00:40:46,620 --> 00:40:47,620
You're crying again.

470
00:40:47,640 --> 00:40:49,040
Did you have another nightmare?

471
00:40:49,440 --> 00:40:50,240
Arthit,

472
00:40:50,260 --> 00:40:52,020
I've told you that I'm fine.

473
00:40:52,040 --> 00:40:53,160
Babe, it's...

474
00:40:53,180 --> 00:40:54,020
It's okay.

475
00:40:54,040 --> 00:40:55,400
Babe... / I'm right here.

476
00:40:56,380 --> 00:40:57,700
Can you tell me about your dream?

477
00:41:00,660 --> 00:41:01,400
Smo... / What?

478
00:41:01,760 --> 00:41:03,520
Smoke got into my eyes.

479
00:41:05,800 --> 00:41:06,440
They're burning.

480
00:41:07,820 --> 00:41:08,800
Hi, Guardian Spirit.

481
00:41:09,340 --> 00:41:11,200
Sorry I haven't paid my respects before.

482
00:41:12,360 --> 00:41:14,080
However, I'm still the owner of this house.

483
00:41:16,640 --> 00:41:17,280
Uh...

484
00:41:18,260 --> 00:41:20,160
I may not have been the owner before,

485
00:41:21,080 --> 00:41:22,740
but Direk gave me this house.

486
00:41:23,520 --> 00:41:24,160
No.

487
00:41:25,200 --> 00:41:27,320
He said he was giving me this house,

488
00:41:27,420 --> 00:41:30,480
but the paperwork isn't finished yet.

489
00:41:31,140 --> 00:41:32,000
Still,

490
00:41:32,360 --> 00:41:33,840
he already gave it to me.

491
00:41:34,000 --> 00:41:35,360
I want you to know that

492
00:41:35,680 --> 00:41:37,400
I won't allow any souls

493
00:41:37,580 --> 00:41:38,800
or evil spirits

494
00:41:38,820 --> 00:41:39,920
to enter this house.

495
00:41:40,060 --> 00:41:41,580
Good or bad,

496
00:41:41,600 --> 00:41:42,560
kick them all out, got it?!

497
00:41:44,780 --> 00:41:45,560
Uh, please.

498
00:41:47,520 --> 00:41:48,840
You too, Guardian Spirit.

499
00:41:50,000 --> 00:41:50,720
Don't ever appear

500
00:41:50,740 --> 00:41:52,320
in front of Daotok.

501
00:41:53,120 --> 00:41:55,000
Please, I beg you.

502
00:41:56,000 --> 00:41:57,920
I just want him to feel at ease,

503
00:41:58,800 --> 00:42:01,160
at least in this house.

504
00:42:01,720 --> 00:42:02,440
Please.

505
00:42:03,120 --> 00:42:04,560
Let him live in peace.

506
00:42:06,960 --> 00:42:07,840
I beg you.

507
00:42:10,640 --> 00:42:11,240
Ouch!

508
00:42:11,680 --> 00:42:12,480
Ow, ow.

509
00:42:13,160 --> 00:42:14,400
Oh, gosh.

510
00:42:14,460 --> 00:42:15,880
Did you play a prank on me?

511
00:42:15,900 --> 00:42:16,760
Ouch!

512
00:42:18,120 --> 00:42:19,120
You promised me.

513
00:42:19,580 --> 00:42:20,600
Keep your word.

514
00:42:30,600 --> 00:42:31,640
Daotok!

515
00:42:37,640 --> 00:42:39,040
How many incense sticks did you light?

516
00:42:39,060 --> 00:42:40,920
Why are your eyes burning so much?

517
00:42:43,240 --> 00:42:44,320
Well...

518
00:42:46,340 --> 00:42:47,280
I don't know.

519
00:42:47,340 --> 00:42:47,960
Huh?

520
00:42:48,360 --> 00:42:49,600
What do you mean you don't know?

521
00:42:50,160 --> 00:42:51,640
Well...

522
00:42:53,360 --> 00:42:54,440
I ordered them this morning,

523
00:42:55,840 --> 00:42:57,000
and I used the whole pack.

524
00:42:57,260 --> 00:42:57,920
Huh?

525
00:42:58,460 --> 00:42:59,440
The whole pack?

526
00:43:13,260 --> 00:43:14,960
Jeez, my eyes are burning so bad.

527
00:43:19,580 --> 00:43:21,020
Luckily, it's only your eyes that are burning,

528
00:43:21,040 --> 00:43:22,560
not the whole house.

529
00:43:23,520 --> 00:43:25,260
Next time, if you don't know something,

530
00:43:25,280 --> 00:43:26,720
just ask me first.

531
00:43:31,300 --> 00:43:32,000
See?

532
00:43:33,300 --> 00:43:34,240
You love scolding me.

533
00:43:36,320 --> 00:43:37,880
And you're so cute when you do it.

534
00:43:39,920 --> 00:43:41,920
If your eyes feel better, let's eat.

535
00:43:43,360 --> 00:43:43,960
Here.

536
00:43:59,540 --> 00:44:00,720
Are you done reading my emotions?

537
00:44:02,040 --> 00:44:03,040
Arthit.

538
00:44:14,400 --> 00:44:15,640
Now, it's my turn to read yours.

539
00:44:33,480 --> 00:44:35,280
Basically,

540
00:44:37,500 --> 00:44:38,560
I have your permission.

541
00:44:40,420 --> 00:44:42,240
You just made that all up.

542
00:44:46,440 --> 00:44:47,440
Breakfast

543
00:44:48,900 --> 00:44:50,080
can wait for now.

544
00:45:16,440 --> 00:45:17,440
Is that what you think?

545
00:45:18,080 --> 00:45:19,380
It's not that I don't believe you

546
00:45:19,400 --> 00:45:21,080
or that I think you're being superstitious.

547
00:45:21,280 --> 00:45:24,160
I know what you and Daotok have been through.

548
00:45:24,500 --> 00:45:27,000
But if I were to explain it scientifically,

549
00:45:27,200 --> 00:45:28,580
that bracelet

550
00:45:28,600 --> 00:45:29,720
is kind of like

551
00:45:29,740 --> 00:45:32,120
something Daotok uses as an emotional anchor.

552
00:45:34,160 --> 00:45:35,560
Emotional anchor?

553
00:45:35,740 --> 00:45:37,080
Based on what you told me,

554
00:45:37,220 --> 00:45:39,160
Daotok has been wearing it since he was young

555
00:45:39,540 --> 00:45:40,860
and believes it can protect him

556
00:45:40,880 --> 00:45:42,160
from those things,

557
00:45:42,600 --> 00:45:43,960
whether it

558
00:45:43,980 --> 00:45:45,240
actually does or not.

559
00:45:45,620 --> 00:45:46,840
Do you remember

560
00:45:46,900 --> 00:45:48,240
the bodily functions...

561
00:45:48,280 --> 00:45:49,800
Wait, Tonfah. Wait a minute.

562
00:45:50,440 --> 00:45:51,120
Like...

563
00:45:51,920 --> 00:45:53,620
can you

564
00:45:53,640 --> 00:45:54,240
explain it to me

565
00:45:54,260 --> 00:45:55,660
in simpler terms?

566
00:45:56,560 --> 00:45:58,560
Hell, I may have gone to medical school,

567
00:45:58,920 --> 00:46:00,120
but did you forget

568
00:46:00,440 --> 00:46:01,360
I dropped out?

569
00:46:01,740 --> 00:46:02,520
Gosh.

570
00:46:02,740 --> 00:46:04,320
You haven't changed at all.

571
00:46:06,100 --> 00:46:07,800
It's not that I don't believe in them.

572
00:46:07,980 --> 00:46:09,680
Whether it's superstition

573
00:46:09,780 --> 00:46:11,640
or your scientific principles,

574
00:46:12,240 --> 00:46:13,360
I believe in both.

575
00:46:14,660 --> 00:46:16,360
About superstition,

576
00:46:16,580 --> 00:46:17,390
I've talked to the monk

577
00:46:17,420 --> 00:46:18,860
that Direk recommended to me.

578
00:46:19,520 --> 00:46:21,160
But when it comes to scientific principles,

579
00:46:22,160 --> 00:46:24,280
I'm giving you the honor of being my advisor.

580
00:46:24,820 --> 00:46:25,560
Yeah?

581
00:46:25,980 --> 00:46:27,640
I'm really honored.

582
00:46:28,820 --> 00:46:29,520
You bastard.

583
00:46:29,840 --> 00:46:31,080
Seriously, though.

584
00:46:31,680 --> 00:46:33,960
Keep it brief and easy to understand,

585
00:46:34,640 --> 00:46:35,480
got it?

586
00:46:35,800 --> 00:46:37,840
If the original bracelet is gone,

587
00:46:38,840 --> 00:46:40,640
just get him a new one.

588
00:46:42,800 --> 00:46:44,780
That's easy for you to say.

589
00:46:44,800 --> 00:46:46,530
But you can't buy it anywhere.

590
00:46:47,900 --> 00:46:49,280
Based on what you told me,

591
00:46:49,720 --> 00:46:51,840
I think the bracelet itself isn't what matters.

592
00:46:51,860 --> 00:46:53,280
What matters is

593
00:46:53,540 --> 00:46:55,100
the love and warmth

594
00:46:55,120 --> 00:46:56,880
from his grandmother that it represents.

595
00:46:57,800 --> 00:46:59,720
He may not have his grandmother anymore,

596
00:46:59,980 --> 00:47:01,400
but he still has you.

597
00:48:48,400 --> 00:48:49,240
Hello, Direk.

598
00:48:51,120 --> 00:48:52,600
The thing in the safe

599
00:48:53,480 --> 00:48:54,480
that belongs to Emma...

600
00:48:56,400 --> 00:48:57,320
Can I have it?

601
00:49:27,220 --> 00:49:28,520
Where have you been?

602
00:49:34,480 --> 00:49:35,800
I was looking for something.

603
00:49:41,880 --> 00:49:43,160
Did you find it?

604
00:49:44,440 --> 00:49:45,760
Want me to help?

605
00:49:59,160 --> 00:50:01,120
This is Emma's bracelet,

606
00:50:01,800 --> 00:50:03,240
the one Direk kept.

607
00:50:03,720 --> 00:50:04,880
It's Emma's?

608
00:50:08,760 --> 00:50:11,320
This means it must be very important

609
00:50:11,700 --> 00:50:13,400
to both Uncle and you.

610
00:50:16,260 --> 00:50:17,880
Please keep it.

611
00:50:18,300 --> 00:50:20,160
I really can't accept this.

612
00:50:39,180 --> 00:50:41,320
Mrs. Puangthong's love

613
00:50:41,860 --> 00:50:43,760
is no longer here to protect you.

614
00:50:46,560 --> 00:50:47,880
From now on,

615
00:50:49,320 --> 00:50:51,120
let my love,

616
00:50:52,520 --> 00:50:53,400
Direk's love,

617
00:50:54,260 --> 00:50:55,440
and Emma's love

618
00:50:55,960 --> 00:50:57,680
keep you safe, Daotok.

619
00:51:04,660 --> 00:51:05,840
I don't know

620
00:51:08,400 --> 00:51:10,160
if this can replace it

621
00:51:11,620 --> 00:51:13,160
or if it'll work,

622
00:51:15,320 --> 00:51:16,280
but...

623
00:51:31,800 --> 00:51:34,000
You don't have to do all this.

624
00:51:39,680 --> 00:51:40,840
I definitely have to,

625
00:51:42,480 --> 00:51:43,600
because in this world,

626
00:51:45,240 --> 00:51:46,840
there's only one you, Daotok.

627
00:51:53,300 --> 00:51:54,520
Thank you.

628
00:51:58,720 --> 00:51:59,480
Mm.

629
00:52:12,120 --> 00:52:12,920
And this...

630
00:52:13,280 --> 00:52:14,240
Arthit...

631
00:52:17,860 --> 00:52:20,640
This is Direk and Emma's wedding ring.

632
00:52:22,940 --> 00:52:24,000
It's a bonus.

633
00:52:30,720 --> 00:52:31,760
Arthit...

634
00:52:32,960 --> 00:52:33,880
A bonus?

635
00:52:35,900 --> 00:52:36,760
Daotok...

636
00:52:40,480 --> 00:52:41,880
will you marry me?

637
00:52:46,360 --> 00:52:47,200
Please.

638
00:52:51,620 --> 00:52:52,400
Mm.

639
00:52:52,940 --> 00:52:53,800
I will.

640
00:53:24,680 --> 00:53:25,520
I love you.

641
00:53:26,140 --> 00:53:26,840
Yes.

642
00:53:27,540 --> 00:53:28,600
I love you, too.

643
00:53:30,040 --> 00:53:31,360
I will take care of you

644
00:53:31,760 --> 00:53:33,440
and never leave your side.

645
00:54:12,880 --> 00:54:14,560
I just realized it's star-shaped.

646
00:54:17,800 --> 00:54:18,840
Mm...

647
00:54:21,120 --> 00:54:22,680
It's almost like Emma knew her son

648
00:54:24,440 --> 00:54:26,440
would one day have a boyfriend named Daotok,

649
00:54:27,840 --> 00:54:29,760
so she prepared this gift beforehand.

650
00:54:32,860 --> 00:54:34,360
I love it.

651
00:54:34,940 --> 00:54:36,240
It's so beautiful.

652
00:54:40,840 --> 00:54:41,960
Not as beautiful as you.

653
00:54:58,040 --> 00:54:59,560
I love you, too.

654
00:55:08,360 --> 00:55:09,320
Read it all.

655
00:55:15,620 --> 00:55:16,400
What does it tell you?

656
00:55:20,280 --> 00:55:21,640
I love you, Arthit.

657
00:55:24,440 --> 00:55:26,120
I love you so much, too.
